  <ferc:DisclosureOfStatusOfAnyMateriallyImportantLegalProceedingsTextBlock id="HH22FBAEA0509E80B804A4341B1670898A" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;"&gt;The Cooperative has filed a lawsuit against its main power supplier and its intermediate power supplier.&amp;#160; The Cooperative claims the main power supplier power rates have been increased due to the supplier's unreasonable and imprudent operation of one of its subsidiaries.&amp;#160; These increased rates were then passed on to the intermediate power supplier and ultimately to the Cooperative's members.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfStatusOfAnyMateriallyImportantLegalProceedingsTextBlock>
